- `bot-config.json` pinned at `ApplyPolicy::Auto` (segment 8's last mutation), which `restore_cfg` would otherwise undo — this permanently leaks the Confirm→Auto test residue into the next run;
- three jsonl files written to the shared deps dir;
- `evo:<pid>` and `u20-gov-target-<id>` rows in `mem_items` (only the `u20-gov` prefix bounds the cross-run blast radius). No other integration test in this crate uses a Drop guard (verified by `impl Drop` search), but the test's coupling to shared bot-config.json + jsonl files makes this one the prime candidate for `scopeguard::defer!` or a small local `struct CleanupOnDrop<'a>(&'a AppHandle<...>, &'a [String], Option<String>, &'a Path)` Drop impl that runs the existing teardown unconditionally.

